/* ROM symbol table for the AmebaD A-cut (RTL8721D) KM0 (LP) mask-ROM fwlib HAL
 * functions -- the symbols declared by component/amebad/fwlib_headers/*.h
 * (UART_/GPIO_/FLASH_/RCC_/GDMA_/EFUSE_/CPU_ClkGet/Set DiagPrintf/crypto_engine ...).
 * Partitioned out of the KM0 (LP) ROM symbol table so the fwlib HAL symbols live
 * with the fwlib_headers component; boot/runtime/fault/FFT symbols stay in the
 * core table. PROVIDE so unreferenced entries cost nothing and a real definition
 * (if ever linked) wins.
 */
